I am Maya.
My home is Mexico.
Now I am in Kochi.
I walk out of the airport.
It is the month of January.
It is good weather here.
But there is a little heat.
I am very happy.
There is a woman near me.
She is also a passenger.
She looks at me and smiles.
"Are you new here?" she asks.
"Yes," I say.
"What is your name?" she asks.
"My name is Maya. What is your name?" I ask.
"My name is Lakshmi," she says.
"Where is your home?" Lakshmi asks.
"My home is Mexico," I say.
"Welcome to Kochi!" she says.
I smile with happiness.
